This is a section that is to be included in Doctoral
theses. It is reserved for shortly and less formally
thanking the less official bodies and private persons
which through their actions supported the author's efforts
to complete their degree and thesis. Such bodies involve
family members and friends, as an example. Note that if you
wish to mention a private person by their full name or in
some other manner that would allow easily identifying them,
you should ask for their permission first.
